# Deny everything, then re-admit exactly what the autoclave image needs.
#
# This form is deliberate. An exclusion list has to be updated every time a new
# secret or bulky drawer appears, and the day it is forgotten the context
# carries `private/` — which holds the notification topic — to the build daemon.
# A deny-all list stays correct without maintenance: a new drawer is excluded
# because everything is, and admitting a file is a visible edit here.
#
# See operations/autoclave/Dockerfile. Build context is this directory.
*

!requirements-dev.txt
!operations/autoclave/agent-brief.md
!operations/autoclave/refresh_claude_token.py
